Primary Purpose:
This document defines the complete visual language of ZyrionOS.

This is the single visual source of truth for the entire application.

Every page, component, layout, dashboard, workspace, AI interface,
billing screen, settings screen, authentication screen, deployment screen,
modal, drawer, form, table and system state MUST follow this document.


============================================================
01. DESIGN SYSTEM PRINCIPLE
============================================================

ZyrionOS must look like a serious enterprise AI infrastructure platform.

The interface must communicate:

- Intelligence
- Reliability
- Infrastructure
- Security
- Control
- Precision
- Premium quality
- Enterprise maturity
- Technical sophistication
- Trust

The interface must NOT look like:

- A generic SaaS template
- A gaming dashboard
- A cryptocurrency dashboard
- A colorful consumer application
- A basic admin panel
- A collection of unrelated cards
- A copied Tailwind template
- A prototype
- A student project


============================================================
02. CORE VISUAL PHILOSOPHY
============================================================

ZyrionOS uses a:

DARK-FIRST
ENTERPRISE
AI-INFRASTRUCTURE
PRECISION
HIGH-DENSITY
PREMIUM

visual language.

The design must feel:

"calm + powerful + intelligent + controlled"


Primary visual hierarchy:

1. Content
2. Structure
3. Action
4. Status
5. Decoration

Decoration must NEVER overpower information.


============================================================
