12. FULL-PAGE PRINCIPLE
============================================================

When the user navigates to a major application module,
that module owns the available application viewport.

Examples:

Create New Project
    -> Full Workspace

Workspace
    -> Full Workspace Interface

Settings
    -> Full Settings Page

Billing
    -> Full Billing Page

Deployments
    -> Full Deployments Page

Dashboard
    -> Full Dashboard

Authentication
    -> Full Authentication Experience


A major page must NEVER behave like a small card
inside another page unless intentionally defined as a modal.


